msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:7
#: eee7a6fe8d194a96a653204dc64457bf
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:9
#: 9be09b7ec0384924ba581243df601a13
msgid ""
"按显式晶面 `hkl` 和滑移方向 `uvw` 生成层错结构或未弛豫的广义层错（GSF）位移路"
"径。卡片先在原子层之间放置切面，再把切面上方的原子作为一个整体沿面内方向移"
"动；它只生成结构，不计算能量，也不做原子弛豫。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:11
#: 8880f969ae2643a1a3178054bc9b605c
msgid ""
"它不限定 fcc、(111) 面或某一种 Burgers 矢量，但输入必须已经按目标晶面定向：第"
"三晶胞矢量要垂直于 `层错面 (h k l)`（`plane_hkl`），否则程序会直接报错。"
"`hkl` 和 `uvw` 都是相对于**当前晶胞基矢**的指数，不会自动识别或重定向原始体相"
"晶胞里的 `(111)`、`[11-2]` 等晶向。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:13
#: 2ef9f86abc3c4bed93c14053d14d1a04
msgid ""
"滑移方向必须本来就在层错面内；若含有面外分量，卡片会报错，不会静默投影成另一"
"个方向。若只是为了补充训练集，可以直接使用输出结构；若要从能量差换算 GSFE，还"
"必须自行确认周期边界中有一个还是两个层错界面，并使用正确的界面面积和界面数。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:15
#: dfa72b71455d4b4ea1c0f6355675733c
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:17
#: f715a658de394049a7f43100c5f30592
msgid ""
"当前晶胞基矢为 $\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c$。用户给出的滑移指数定义"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:19
#: ae26c34813ff47d4861b123f1c790a46
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf b_{\\mathrm{slip}}=u\\mathbf a+v\\mathbf b+w\\mathbf c,\n"
"\\qquad hu+kv+lw=0,\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:24
#: f2b00d0bcb644623b6c44ea4bf692288
msgid ""
"第二式是滑移方向位于 $(hkl)$ 面内的必要检查。对位移参数 $\\lambda$，分数向量"
"模式使用 $\\Delta\\mathbf r=\\lambda\\mathbf b_{\\mathrm{slip}}$；Å 模式使用 "
"\\(\\Delta\\mathbf r=d\\,\\mathbf b_{\\mathrm{slip}}/ \\|\\mathbf "
"b_{\\mathrm{slip}}\\|\\)。切面上方原子统一加该位移，下方保持不动。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:29
#: 371e0752523641c6bf464d47e8987bb6
msgid "若用能量差计算广义层错能，应另行使用"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:31
#: bb898f0282444bec93bed13e73574be6
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\gamma(\\lambda)=\n"
"\\frac{E(\\lambda)-E(0)}{n_{\\mathrm{interface}}A},\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:36
#: 639a5610b3d64c0da6fb0b6ce9bb3830
msgid ""
"其中 $A$ 是层错面面积，$n_{\\mathrm{interface}}$ 是周期晶胞中的界面数。本卡只"
"生成路径， 不会替用户判断 $n_{\\mathrm{interface}}$ 或计算 $\\gamma$。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:39
#: 66aadfe5266743a0a28e7c957b487871
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:41
#: ca147a530de241649ece9323733faf95
msgid "场景：模型在指定滑移系的 GSFE 峰值严重偏低"
msgstr "Scenario: The GSFE peak is too low for a specified slip system"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:43
#: 2562caddf03a4b23afd85be3fe3ea376
msgid ""
"你在 fcc Ni 上训练了 NEP，体相和弹性响应都不错，但 (111)<112> 的 GSFE 峰值比 "
"DFT 低很多。训练集里虽然有随机扰动和表面，但没有沿这个滑移系系统移动半晶体的"
"结构，模型没学到层间错排的能量代价。"
msgstr ""
"An fcc Ni NEP has good bulk and elastic response but strongly underestimates "
"the (111)<112> GSFE peak. Random perturbations and surfaces do not replace "
"systematic half-crystal displacement along that slip system."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:45
#: 68f9a07aac004241966b1f2311ead70d
msgid ""
"**输入：** 一个 fcc111 slab-oriented 周期超胞，例如 `Crystal Prototype "
"Builder` 的 `fcc111` 原型。"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** A periodic fcc111 slab-oriented cell, such as the `fcc111` "
"prototype from `Crystal Prototype Builder`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:47
#: b833ab659b2943d9b519e69a2e7fb836
msgid ""
"**目标：** 沿当前 slab cell 的 `(001)` 面和面内 `[100]` 周期方向生成 0 到 1 "
"个滑移向量的路径，步长 0.1；在这个特定定向晶胞里，`(001)` 对应原始 fcc 的 "
"`(111)` 面。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:49
#: cb7814618f794c9b8ce6bfa46a621659
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:50
#: 069078852c3b44c7b7ec579e26f3da1d
msgid "`层错面 (h k l)`填 `[0, 0, 1]`；"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:51
#: e5156b9813e04880890b6fc7dab114d5
msgid "`滑移方向 [u v w]`填 `[1, 0, 0]`；"
msgstr ""

