#: 3731d8ad2d4445f1bbab852c39529347
msgid "`位移单位`选择“滑移向量分数”；"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:54
#: 4a10d8fdf2fd469b820461e19f0bf5d4
msgid "`切面位置`选择“中间原子层”。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:56
#: 2f6297060d964769843ed887b327a9c0
msgid "**输出：** 11 个未弛豫层错结构，带 `GSFE(hkl=001,uvw=100,d=...)` 标签。"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** Eleven unrelaxed fault structures labeled "
"`GSFE(hkl=001,uvw=100,d=...)`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:58
#: ce50baaf2dee4b8ea4c4305d83e07bdc
msgid ""
"**怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 对输出结构做 DFT 单点或短弛豫后加入训练集，重训"
"再扫同一 GSFE 路径。峰值、局部极小位置和曲线对称性应更接近 DFT；如果只有峰值"
"改善但曲线仍有锯齿，把步长从 0.1 缩到 0.05。"
msgstr ""
"**How to verify the improvement:** Obtain DFT single points or consistently "
"defined short relaxations, retrain, and rescan the same path. Compare peak "
"height, local minima, and curve symmetry with DFT. If the peak improves but "
"the curve remains jagged, refine the displacement step from 0.1 to 0.05."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:60
#: 85e10eac1aad4280b0df4d6e727d5b9a
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:62
#: 57356902859a44a581b80099781d8d2f
msgid "层错面 (h k l)（plane_hkl）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:64
#: 5b2040c6f2cc4b58b39d534f8786eb83
msgid ""
"`Sequence[int]`，默认 `(0, 0, 1)`。当前晶胞基矢下的 Miller 指数，定义层错面的"
"法向；该法向必须平行于第三晶胞矢量。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:66
#: a48d0f678dcb4c03b9e656b42eee8fba
msgid ""
"低指数面最常用：fcc111 slab cell 里用 `(001)` 表示原始 fcc `(111)` 面。`(0, "
"0, 0)` 没有物理意义，程序会直接报错。普通 cubic fcc cell 里的 `(111)` 不满足 "
"slab-oriented 要求，不能直接使用。"
msgstr ""
"Low-index planes are typical. In an fcc111-oriented slab cell, `(001)` "
"denotes the original fcc `(111)` plane. `(0,0,0)` is invalid. A conventional "
"cubic fcc cell with `(111)` does not satisfy the required slab orientation "
"without reorientation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:68
#: a32d0533ee184cd7841019a0131c7ad2
msgid "滑移方向 [u v w]（slip_uvw）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:70
#: 919bf2aeebd4449ca6399e0cc33c47ec
msgid ""
"`Sequence[int]`，默认 `(1, 0, 0)`。当前晶胞基矢下的方向指数，真实滑移向量为 "
"`u*a + v*b + w*c`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:72
#: 9b6c340daa534b35bc63e70017f6aca2
msgid ""
"方向必须位于 `层错面 (h k l)`（`plane_hkl`）面内；在晶格指数下等价于 `h*u + "
"k*v + l*w = 0`。不满足时程序会报错，避免用户填写 `[u v w]`，实际却得到另一个"
"投影方向。对于 fcc111 slab cell，可以用 `[100]`、`[010]` 或另一个面内方向；如"
"果要扫特定 partial 位移，需要让当前晶胞的面内基矢或 Å 位移范围对应目标 "
"Burgers 矢量。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:74
#: 5a6479c6627044678239e35851eec77c
msgid "位移范围（displacement_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:76
#: be2c89fc115a4e17a44e65faff898b4f
msgid ""
"`Sequence[float]`，默认 `(0.0, 1.0, 0.5)`。格式是 `[起点, 终点, 步长]`，扫描"
"滑移位移。"
msgstr ""
"`Sequence[float]`, default `(0.0,1.0,0.5)`. Slip displacement scan as "
"`[start,stop,step]`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:78
#: e24456e914c54416b16af60a8fe99af8
msgid ""
"如果 `displacement_unit = \"fraction_of_vector\"`，`1.0` 表示完整 `滑移方向 "
"[u v w]`（`slip_uvw`）向量；如果单位是 `angstrom`，数值就是沿该方向的实际距"
"离。起点和终点都包含在输出中，步长必须为正。GSFE 曲线通常需要至少 0.05–0.1 的"
"分辨率；只做 smoke 时可以用 0、0.5、1.0 三个点快速确认几何没错。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:80
