"动”或“没有原子移动”的伪层错。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:101
#: b1d6b2a210774b8089ef687a99b611c7
msgid "厚度分数（cut_fraction）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:103
#: 9325a1cc610e4dbca7f4c60d7e16b4b9
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `0.5`。当 `cut_mode = \"fractional\"` 时使用，界面范围是 0 到 "
"0.9999；核心参数必须满足 `0 <= cut_fraction <= 1`，但 `1` 会因为上方没有原子"
"而报错。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:105
#: 9264fcc4c37f46f2bc65e72c43368335
msgid ""
"`0.5` 接近中间切面；`0.25` 会让更多原子处在上半部分并被滑移；`0.75` 则只移动"
"靠近上侧的原子。这个值越靠近 0 或 1，移动的原子数越不平衡，适合 slab 或非均匀"
"层结构，不适合普通体相路径的第一轮扫描。"
msgstr ""
"`0.5` is near the middle. `0.25` shifts more atoms and `0.75` only the upper "
"region. Values near 0 or 1 create unbalanced halves and are more appropriate "
"for slabs or nonuniform layering than a first bulk scan."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:107
#: 3ff8149ac10f4d5f87f7d0a73d3e6d11
msgid "生效条件：`切面位置`（`cut_mode`）必须是 `fractional`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:109
#: 0d0c933e90fa4817b576bdd0e35f288c
msgid "下方原子层索引（layer_index）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:111
#: b03d137bffab4faeae00bf9e03e528fa
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 `0`。当 `cut_mode = \"layer_index\"` 时使用。索引指定切面下方的原"
"子层，切面实际放在该层和下一层的中间。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:113
#: 92e04dd8a4ef4b2b89af0e719e1a4e41
msgid ""
"索引从 0 开始，必须选到顶层以下的位置；如果选到最后一层，程序会报错，因为那样"
"没有上半部分可移动。层状材料、slab 或你已经知道滑移面夹在哪两层之间时，用它"
"比 `middle` 更明确。"
msgstr ""
"Indices start at 0 and must select an interface below the top layer. "
"Choosing the final layer fails because no upper atoms remain. This mode is "
"clearest when the interface between discrete layers is known."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:115
#: d3b217f9fded4123a2737f98e2a2561c
msgid ""
"生效条件：`切面位置`（`cut_mode`）必须是 `下方原子层索引`（`layer_index`）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:117
#: 01929e79a0a844fba9cb59ea7022b806
msgid "将移动后的原子包回晶胞（wrap）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:119
#: 27a5d778ddea4c97893b9b83ce07d5dd
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `true`。打开后把滑移后的原子坐标包回周期晶胞内；关闭则保留真实 "
"Cartesian 位移。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `true`. Wrap shifted atoms back into the periodic cell. "
"Disable to retain unwrapped Cartesian displacements for geometry inspection."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:121
#: c9821a294fc14887891a59fae49ca442
msgid ""
"训练集导出通常建议打开，避免原子跑出可视化盒子导致后续工具误判。做几何调试或"
"想直接看上半部分移动了多远时可以关闭；关闭后输出仍然是同一个周期 cell，但坐标"
"可能超过原胞边界。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:123
#: ce0333f636f44919b9b546b3443e547c
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:125
#: c7bbe74583fa4181afb45ea33f7c98c3
msgid "对应 Atomsk 的 fcc (111) 半晶体滑移"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:127
#: 74db4ad1fa8c47cbb137079db19f8d33
msgid ""
"参考脚本先把原始 fcc 晶体定向为 `x=[1-10]`、`y=[11-2]`、`z=[111]`，再移动 `z "
"> 0.5*box` 的上半部分，位移沿当前 y 方向。把同一已定向结构送入本卡片时，对应"
"参数是："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:129
#: 9886697e9f474d6282d747e1b3139f3b
msgid "`plane_hkl = [0, 0, 1]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:130
#: 6a8a0b5593544313b15e94021e5c8d3a
msgid "`slip_uvw = [0, 1, 0]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:131
#: 31d4f1afae65498286408a9effc66a38
msgid "`displacement_range = [0.0, 1.47786, 0.073893]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:132
#: 4115d9394b7347b1984be52faa23170b
msgid "`displacement_unit = \"angstrom\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:133
#: ff4049ee2fe244509e73e6d254734755
msgid "`cut_mode = \"fractional\"`，`cut_fraction = 0.5`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:135
#: e00a01d2855146349ae8fc279118edb1
msgid ""
"对晶格常数 $a=3.62$ Å，终点 $1.47786 \\approx a/\\sqrt{6}$ Å，正好扫描一个 "
"fcc Shockley partial 位移。参考脚本随后增加真空层；本卡片不自动改晶胞，因此若"
"目标是含真空的单内部层错 slab，应在上游先准备好真空和定向。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:137
#: 1f8cb1ac130e4d74ab9f185aebc80c6c
msgid "fcc111 slab 完整分数路径"
msgstr "Complete fractional path in an fcc111 slab"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:139
#: 4d32926037f942f488efe19b8c4c1d55
msgid "适合 GSFE 曲线第一轮覆盖，输出 11 个结构。"
msgstr "Suitable for an initial GSFE curve; produces 11 structures."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:141
#: 9c8dd2cf60bb49219ce149a386331eaa
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"StrictGSFEPathCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"plane_hkl\": [0, 0, 1],\n"
"    \"slip_uvw\": [1, 0, 0],\n"
"    \"displacement_range\": [0.0, 1.0, 0.1],\n"
"    \"displacement_unit\": \"fraction_of_vector\",\n"
"    \"cut_mode\": \"middle\",\n"
"    \"cut_fraction\": 0.5,\n"
"    \"layer_index\": 0,\n"
"    \"wrap\": true\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:158
#: f4e5b17b316a4c51af128310ce8e4211
msgid "小位移 Angstrom 探针"
msgstr "Small-displacement Å probe"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:160
#: 50b14aefa0ce4236af08b1d7a7e66d65
msgid "适合只想补层间微小错排，不扫完整滑移周期。"
msgstr "Use for small interlayer offsets without a complete period."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:162
#: e500b47f9f254084a7b6e0cda30125e4
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"StrictGSFEPathCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"plane_hkl\": [0, 0, 1],\n"
"    \"slip_uvw\": [1, 0, 0],\n"
"    \"displacement_range\": [0.0, 0.5, 0.1],\n"
"    \"displacement_unit\": \"angstrom\",\n"
"    \"cut_mode\": \"middle\",\n"
"    \"cut_fraction\": 0.5,\n"
"    \"layer_index\": 0,\n"
"    \"wrap\": true\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:179
#: 80fd0123d3be4c9abd534335cb0db83f
msgid "指定层间切面"
msgstr "Explicit interlayer cut"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:181
#: ab94c9f70bc542d5920a8f442ecfe30f
msgid "适合 slab 或层状材料，希望从第 2 层上方开始滑移。"
msgstr ""
"Use for a slab or layered material when motion should begin above a known "
"layer."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:183
#: 277f8c263b634d3abebc9623333b39dd
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"StrictGSFEPathCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"plane_hkl\": [0, 0, 1],\n"
"    \"slip_uvw\": [1, 0, 0],\n"
"    \"displacement_range\": [0.0, 1.0, 0.25],\n"
"    \"displacement_unit\": \"angstrom\",\n"
"    \"cut_mode\": \"layer_index\",\n"
"    \"cut_fraction\": 0.5,\n"
"    \"layer_index\": 1,\n"
"    \"wrap\": false\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:200
#: 403bed49e9e54a25a5a38be6267afb19
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:202
#: 2e5c716d3e47450e9a30bc54befcd57d
msgid ""
"`Super Cell` → `Stacking Fault / GSFE Path`：先扩胞，再切面滑移，降低小胞周期"
"重复带来的假相互作用。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:203
#: eff32cf61e6e4604844728a321319000
msgid ""
"`Stacking Fault / GSFE Path` → `Atomic Perturb`：在每个位移点附近加入小扰动，"
"让模型不仅见过理想路径，也见过热扰动后的层错环境。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:204
#: 0095c977927d4101836e500b8abc4a75
msgid ""
"`Bain Path` → `Stacking Fault / GSFE Path`：先改变晶胞形状，再扫层错路径，用"
"于相变或应变下的 GSFE 数据。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:206
#: 9e252d2d5eba4ac7a0f0c0ce250833cf
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:208
#: de735b868cd247248dbe554236a0ead4
msgid ""
"**程序提示 slip_uvw 不在层错面内。** 检查 `h*u + k*v + l*w` 是否为 0。卡片不"
"会把面外分量静默投影掉，请填写真实的面内晶向。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:210
#: edb16f81ba7e47f293db7f4262013ff2
msgid ""
"**移动的原子层不是预期那一半。** 先切到 `下方原子层索引`（`layer_index`）模"
"式，用离散层索引明确切面；普通 `middle` 适合均匀体相，不一定适合 slab。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:212
#: f5930074f2ec4a7c81c2fad2128a0b10
msgid ""
"**输出坐标超过晶胞边界。** 打开 `将移动后的原子包回晶胞`（`wrap`）。如果你为"
"了检查真实位移故意关闭了 `将移动后的原子包回晶胞`（`wrap`），这不是错误，但后"
"续导出和可视化要知道坐标未包回。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:214
#: bcea10ec2a6343848632652c1df0cb38
msgid ""
"**能量差除以面积后为什么和参考 GSFE 差一倍。** 先检查周期方向上有几个层错界"
"面。纯周期体相超胞把上半部分整体平移时，胞内切面和周期边界都可能形成错配；若"
"两处界面等价，换算单界面 GSFE 时还要除以 2。含真空 slab 通常只有一个内部切"
"面，但仍应检查几何而不是按卡片名称直接假设。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:216
#: fe804b5e0078442f94c9697266752b4c
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:218
#: 30710f143d634b6099b836930f0116ce
msgid "`GSFE(hkl={hkl},uvw={uvw},d={位移量})`"
msgstr "`GSFE(hkl={hkl},uvw={uvw},d={displacement})`"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:220
#: 5332254466c142708034613fbc6e5343
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:222
#: 216ec33c29d94e0c8f2cd61185a81e2d
msgid "无随机性。同一输入结构和同一参数会生成完全一致的结构列表。"
msgstr ""
"Deterministic: the same input structure and parameters produce exactly the "
"same structure list."

#~ msgid "严格 GSFE 路径（Strict GSFE Path）"
#~ msgstr "Strict GSFE Path"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "按显式晶面 `hkl` 和滑移方向 `uvw` 生成未弛豫的广义层错能（GSFE）路径结构。"
#~ "输入必须已经是 slab-oriented cell：第三晶胞方向要垂直于 `plane_hkl`，否则"
#~ "周期边界会把断层面错接成重合或过近原子，程序会直接报错。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Generate unrelaxed generalized stacking-fault energy (GSFE) path "
#~ "structures from an explicit plane `hkl` and slip direction `uvw`. The "
#~ "input must already be slab oriented: its third cell direction must be "
#~ "normal to `plane_hkl`. Otherwise periodic boundaries can reconnect the "
#~ "fault into overlapping or excessively close atoms, and the card fails "
#~ "explicitly."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "相比 `Stacking Fault`，这张卡把滑移方向写成明确的晶向，并提供 `middle`、"
#~ "`fractional`、`layer_index` 三种切面选择。它适合你已经知道目标滑移系统，想"
#~ "要严格控制 GSFE 路径几何的场景。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Unlike `Stacking Fault`, this card specifies a crystallographic slip "
#~ "direction and offers `middle`, `fractional`, and `layer_index` cut modes. "
#~ "Use it when the target slip system is known and the GSFE geometry must be "
#~ "controlled explicitly."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**目标：** 沿 slab cell 的 `(001)` 面和面内 `[100]` 周期方向生成 0 到 1 个"
#~ "滑移向量的路径，步长 0.1；这个 `(001)` 就是原始 fcc 的 `(111)` 面。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Objective:** In the slab cell, scan from 0 to one slip vector in 0.1 "
#~ "increments along in-plane `[100]` on `(001)`. In this oriented basis, "
#~ "`(001)` corresponds to the original fcc `(111)` plane."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Sequence[int]`，默认 `(0, 0, 1)`。Miller 指数，定义哪一个晶面作为层错切"
#~ "面；该面的法向必须平行于第三晶胞方向。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Sequence[int]`, default `(0,0,1)`. Miller indices of the fault plane. "
#~ "Its normal must be parallel to the third cell direction."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Sequence[int]`，默认 `(1, 0, 0)`。晶向指数，定义滑移方向；程序会把它投影"
#~ "到 `plane_hkl` 所在平面内。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Sequence[int]`, default `(1,0,0)`. Crystallographic direction projected "
#~ "into `plane_hkl` to define slip."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果 `slip_uvw` 平行于晶面法向，投影后长度为零，程序会报错。对于 fcc111 "
#~ "slab cell，先用 `[100]` 或另一个面内周期方向做完整周期路径；如果要扫特定 "
#~ "partial 位移，需要把 slab cell 的面内基矢先构造成对应路径。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If `slip_uvw` is parallel to the plane normal, its in-plane projection is "
#~ "zero and the card fails. For an fcc111 slab cell, begin with `[100]` or "
#~ "another periodic in-plane direction. A specific partial path requires "
#~ "constructing an in-plane basis that represents it."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "如果 `displacement_unit = \"fraction_of_vector\"`，`1.0` 表示完整投影滑移"
#~ "向量；如果单位是 `angstrom`，数值就是 A。GSFE 曲线通常需要至少 0.05-0.1 的"
#~ "分辨率；只做 smoke 时可以用 0、0.5、1.0 三个点快速确认几何没错。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "With `displacement_unit=\"fraction_of_vector\"`, `1.0` is the full "
#~ "projected slip vector. With `angstrom`, values are Å. A GSFE curve "
#~ "commonly needs 0.05-0.1 resolution; points 0, 0.5, and 1.0 are sufficient "
#~ "only for a geometry smoke test."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `\"fraction_of_vector\"`。决定 `displacement_range` 里的数值怎"
#~ "么转成真实位移。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `\"fraction_of_vector\"`. Converts `displacement_range` "
#~ "values to physical displacements."

#~ msgid "位移 = 数值乘以投影后的 `slip_uvw` 向量"
#~ msgstr "Displacement equals the value times the projected `slip_uvw` vector"

#~ msgid "扫完整 GSFE 周期或按晶向分数描述路径"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Scan a complete GSFE period or express a path as fractions of a "
#~ "crystallographic vector"

#~ msgid "位移 = 数值 A，方向为投影滑移方向的单位向量"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Displacement is the value in Å along the normalized projected slip "
#~ "direction"

#~ msgid "按投影坐标中位数切开"
#~ msgstr "Cut at the median projected coordinate"

#~ msgid "普通超胞快速生成上下两半"
#~ msgstr "Quickly split a roughly uniform cell into two halves"

#~ msgid "按投影坐标范围的 `cut_fraction` 位置切开"
#~ msgstr "Cut at `cut_fraction` of the projected coordinate range"

#~ msgid "按排序后的离散层位置切开"
#~ msgstr "Cut between sorted discrete layers"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 `0.5`。当 `cut_mode = \"fractional\"` 时使用，范围是 0 到 "
#~ "1。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0.5`; used with `cut_mode=\"fractional\"`, range 0-1."

